<title>BELGIUM: EU to continue review of sugar product content.</title>
<headline>EU to continue review of sugar product content.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union sugar officials agreed to continue a technical review of the coefficients used to calculate the sugar content of manufactured products, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is still some work to do at a technical level and it was agreed to resume the discussion in a month's time,&quot; the official said after a weekly meeting of the sugar management committee on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
